    64	
    65	TIDY-477 originally moved reusable popup contracts to the then-current elements package, overlay state to the then-current stores workspace, active-resource/selection state to its resource group, and generic ResourceError to DataFn. The current destinations are `client/ui/elements/modal`, `client/application/shell/overlays`, `client/capabilities/resources`, and DataFn respectively. The default error message belongs to `client/capabilities/notifications`. The inventory destinations follow the current owners so baseline enum validation stays reproducible. See client-boundaries.md for the permanent overlay host contract and the remaining application-specific dependencies.

