    79	
    80	Use this when the frontend is local but account auth should hit the deployed dev
    81	Cloudflare Workers.
    82	
    83	Do not start a local account service. By default, the app derives the account
    84	domain from the current product host. For example, `https://local.memotron.app`
    85	uses `https://account-{region}-local.memotron.app`.
    86	
    87	To force a deployed account environment from a local app, start the app with a
    88	regional account URL template:
    89	
    90	```bash
    91	VITE_ACCOUNT_BASE_URL_TEMPLATE=https://account-{region}-dev.{domain} npm --workspace nucleus-app run debug
